/* the Reformed, Vitringa and Lutheran decks (2026-10-22), as decks.html has them; Vitringa as the data session's reviewed prototype sets him; the problems of the Reformed deck (Voetius's Syllabus) and of the Lutheran (Quenstedt's questions) with their seals, filters, forks, folds, objections, who-agrees strip and graph band (tradition-graphics.css's share bars) */
